[ti:Going on Holiday]
[by:更多学习内容，请到VeryCD.com搜索“露珠”]

[00:00.82]Lesson 83 | 第83课
[00:03.18]Going on holiday | 去度假
[00:06.52]Listen to the tape then answer this question. | 听录音,然后回答这个问题。
[00:12.15]Where did Sam go for his holiday this year? | 萨姆今年去哪里度假了?
[00:19.00]Hello, Sam. | 你好,萨姆。
[00:20.59]Come in. | 请进。
[00:23.06]Hi, Sam. | 嗨,萨姆。
[00:24.71]We're having lunch. | 我们正在吃午饭。
[00:26.88]Do you want to have lunch with us? | 你愿意和我们一起吃午饭吗?
[00:30.98]No, thank you, Tom. | 不,谢谢你,汤姆。
[00:33.18]I've already had lunch. | 我已经吃过午饭了。
[00:35.97]I had lunch at half past twelve. | 我十二点半吃的午饭。
[00:39.98]Have a cup of coffee then. | 那就来杯咖啡吧。
[00:42.93]I've just had a cup, thank you. | 谢谢你,我刚喝过一杯。
[00:46.25]I had one after my lunch. | 我午饭后喝了一杯。
[00:49.96]Let's go into the living room, Carol. | 卡罗尔,我们去客厅吧。
[00:53.75]We can have our coffee there. | 我们可以在那里喝咖啡。
[00:57.12]Excuse the mess, Sam. | 萨姆,请原谅房间的凌乱。
[01:00.33]This room's very untidy. | 这房间非常不整洁。
[01:03.51]We're packing our suitcases. | 我们正在收拾行李箱。
[01:06.42]We're going to leave tomorrow. | 我们打算明天出发。
[01:09.85]Tom and I are going to have a holiday. | 汤姆和我打算去度假。
[01:14.33]Aren't you lucky! | 你们真幸运!
[01:17.49]When are you going to have a holiday, Sam? | 萨姆,你什么时候去度假?
[01:21.58]I don't know. | 我不知道。
[01:23.46]I've already had my holiday this year. | 今年我已经休过假了。
[01:28.10]Where did you go? | 你去哪里了?
[01:30.22]I stayed at home! | 我待在家里了!